The '''Gordian Reach''',<ref name="RO World Locations">{{SW|url=news/where-in-the-galaxy-are-the-worlds-of-rogue-one|text=Where in the Galaxy Are the Worlds of ''Rogue One''?|int=Where in the Galaxy Are the Worlds of Rogue One?}}</ref> also known as the '''Gordian Reach sector''',<ref name="ATLAS">''[[Star Wars: Galactic Atlas]]''</ref> was a [[sector]] located in [[the galaxy]]'s [[Outer Rim Territories]] that contained the [[Yavin system]], site of the [[Battle of Yavin]] above the [[moon]] [[Yavin 4]] during the [[Galactic Civil War]].<ref name="USW" /> It also contained the [[planet]] [[Arda]].<ref name="RO World Locations" /> The sector took its name from an old [[Hyperspace route|hyperlane]] that passed through it.<ref name="BMF">{{BuildFalconCite|18|Guide to the Galaxy}}</ref>

{{Sec-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
The Gordian Reach was first mentioned in [[1979]] in [[Marvel Comics]]' [[Star Wars (1977) 25|''Star Wars'' (1977) 25]], now part of the [[Star Wars Legends|''Star Wars'' Legends]] continuity. The sector was confirmed to be [[canon]] by the reference book ''[[Ultimate Star Wars]]'', which was released in [[2015]].

